OL,5,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FJohn and Sharyn host at the
OL,7,     Ffive-star Ixworth House in Bury St
OL,8,     FEdmunds, Suffolk. John reveals his
OL,9,     Fhidden talents, but his
OL,10,     Fperformance at breakfast proves
OL,11,     Fhard to digest.
OL,12,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FPart-time panto dame Graham
OL,14,     Fwelcomes his rivals to the
OL,15,     FGeorgian House and Mews in York.
OL,16,     FBut some of his guests make
OL,17,     Fhair-raising discoveries in their
OL,18,     Frooms.
